  "slug": "lawn-care-warranty-request-form",
  "title": "Lawn Care Warranty Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Control mowing, cultivation, irrigation review, treatment, and property handoff through verified identity, domain-specific observations, evidence, authorization, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original, workflow-complete lawn care warranty request for turf zones, plantings, irrigation features, and service equipment. It connects service plan, product label, site map, and instructions to present conditions, repeatable evidence, decisions, unresolved work, and the receiving party's handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use when a lawn-service coordinator must investigate a lawn care warranty or callback without treating the request as a coverage decision before identity, chronology, condition, and evidence are reviewed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
